From: aruni <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] tools: rsa-sign: link with OpenSSL 4.0

OpenSSL 4.0 removes the ENGINE API, so host tools fail to link.
Define OPENSSL_ENGINE_STUBS to use the OpenSSL compatibility stubs.

---
--- a/lib/rsa/rsa-sign.c
+++ b/lib/rsa/rsa-sign.c
@@ -12,6 +12,8 @@
 #include <image.h>
 #include <time.h>
 #include <u-boot/fdt-libcrypto.h>
+/* OpenSSL 4.0 removed the ENGINE API. Use its stubs so host tools still link. */
+#define OPENSSL_ENGINE_STUBS
 #include <openssl/bn.h>
 #include <openssl/ec.h>
 #include <openssl/rsa.h>
